<!doctype html><html><head><meta charset="utf-8"><title>MedRep Connect Vacancy Template</title>
<style>body{font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#172033}h1{text-align:center;color:#1e3a8a}p{text-align:center;color:#475569}table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse}th,td{border:1px solid #475569;padding:10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top}thead th{background:#eaf0ff;color:#1e3a8a;font-size:16pt}tbody th{width:32%;background:#f8fafc}tbody td{height:88px;min-width:60%;}</style></head>
<body><h1>VACANCY DETAILS</h1><p>MedRep Connect · Each Entry box has space for at least 50 characters. Wrap longer answers onto another line.</p>
<table><thead><tr><th>Data</th><th>Entry</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>Job title</th><td><br><br><br><br></td></tr><tr><th>Company</th><td><br><br><br><br></td></tr><tr><th>Category (MR / ABM / Other)</th><td><br><br><br><br></td></tr><tr><th>City / location</th><td><br><br><br><br></td></tr><tr><th>HQ (MR / ABM)</th><td><br><br><br><br></td></tr><tr><th>Division</th><td><br><br><br><br></td></tr><tr><th>Salary / incentives</th><td><br><br><br><br></td></tr><tr><th>Experience</th><td><br><br><br><br></td></tr><tr><th>Qualification</th><td><br><br><br><br></td></tr><tr><th>Age limit</th><td><br><br><br><br></td></tr><tr><th>Number of openings</th><td><br><br><br><br></td></tr><tr><th>Manager name</th><td><br><br><br><br></td></tr><tr><th>Contact number</th><td><br><br><br><br></td></tr><tr><th>Alternate / email</th><td><br><br><br><br></td></tr><tr><th>Job description</th><td><br><br><br><br></td></tr></tbody></table></body></html>